        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The reduction in net revenue of our distribution business is therefore compensated with a reduction in our costs for energy that we would otherwise acquire to sell to these customers.",
        "start_character": 116782,
        "end_character": 116965
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To achieve this goal, we have made significant commitments to decarbonize our businesses, further integrate the segments in which we operate to capture synergies and achieve scale in products and services with discipline in capital management.",
        "start_character": 128005,
        "end_character": 128248
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have been working to improve our environmental, social and governance practices and to integrate sustainability into our business through a comprehensive approach, based on systemic planning and execution, prioritizing risk and impact management and establishing a positive social, economic and environmental legacy in the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 122589,
        "end_character": 122944
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2021, we established the Sustainable Development Committee, a permanent statutory body that advises the Board of Directors, aiming to ensure that we remain among the companies with the best ESG governance practices and actions and guiding our sustainability strategy.",
        "start_character": 132477,
        "end_character": 132747
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through an annual report, Copel Integrated Report (Relato Integrado Copel), we reinforce our commitment to sustainable development and hold ourselves accountable for our performance in relation to economic, social, environmental and governance aspects.",
        "start_character": 134111,
        "end_character": 134363
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under Brazilian law, we are required to provide reduced rates to certain low-income residential customers.",
        "start_character": 67665,
        "end_character": 67771
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are continuing to implement compact grid design distribution lines in urban areas with large concentration of trees in the vicinity of the distribution grid.",
        "start_character": 53423,
        "end_character": 53583
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate in the Free Contracting Environment (Ambiente de Contratação Livre, the “ACL”) through our wholly owned subsidiaries Copel Geração e Transmissão and Copel Comercialização (Copel Mercado Livre).",
        "start_character": 63955,
        "end_character": 64159
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate under concessions granted by the Brazilian government for our generation, transmission and distribution businesses.",
        "start_character": 85515,
        "end_character": 85641
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "This risk does not impact our distribution business, since we are allowed to increase the tariffs of our distribution customers to compensate any costs arising from this hydrological risk.",
        "start_character": 211851,
        "end_character": 212039
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are focused on initiatives to assess the technical, economic, and environmental feasibility of expanding existing projects in business areas according to the strategic planning presented at Copel Day 2025, available on our IR website.",
        "start_character": 37208,
        "end_character": 37445
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000155",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000155-a685e10a97908d43",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000155",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
